Package: xdg-audit
Version: @VERSION@-@RELEASE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Ulther Ego <ultherego@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), coreutils, procps, python3-tk
Recommends: python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Suggests: python3-pyqt6
Homepage: https://github.com/ultherego/xdg-audit
Description: Audit and safely quarantine leftover user configuration and data
 Inspects installed applications and user XDG directories. Scanning is
 read-only. MOVE, RESTORE and PURGE require separate explicit confirmations.
 GTK, Qt and Tk interfaces are supported. No service or autostart is installed.
